      "review_description": "Salesperson arrived on time and made a professional presentation and could answer all our questions. I then went to their showroom in Winnellie where their engineer gave a presentation on how the Endphase system compared to inline, string system worked. Also pointed out the various solar panels they used.The installation was another big plus because they have their own permanent team of installers, not fly by nighters other companies use.The whole system was installed and connected to the grid within 10 days of signing the contract",
