      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "After looking at Solar options, various companies and salespersons visits, for some time I was recommended Country Solar NT by an electrician friend who was impressed with their work....One visit later from Lenny was all I needed as he took the time to explain the entire system in one syllable words without the hard sell...Once we had decided to go ahead with the system it took only about ten days from visit to install and having the system up and running and getting the benefits of solar, not one system, but two on two properties.Last problems with PAWA and this virus thingy were no issue for Kylie and the support crew, sorted that and had the cut overs with new meter sorted within a couple of days, now two very happy customers.And who knew they are all basically local personnel and money staying in the Territory, and follow up phone calls at 7 pm the night before a long weekend to ensure and reassure everything is happening as it should.Thatâ€™s Service ( with a capital)No hesitation in recommending Country Solar NT, and their work Is really top notch.",
